# A While loop whose predicate is a reduction over the value it guards, with
# a full pass in the body: the loop lowering, not the body's.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Simple Domain: While
    Using: (xs) -> max(xs) > 1
    Cursed Technique: Map Each
        Using: (x) -> if x > 1 then x / 2 else x
Maximum Technique: Sum
Reveal: stdout
